MTR-ANTE (MTRSteamLoco) - MODIFIED BUILD
========================================

This is an UNOFFICIAL modified build of ANTE (Aphrodite's Nemo's Transit Expansion),
based on upstream MTR-ANTE 1.1.0.

  Upstream:        https://github.com/aphrodite281/mtr-ante
  Upstream authors: Zbx1425, Aphrodite281
  License:         MIT - full text in META-INF/LICENSE
                   Copyright (c) 2022-present Zbx1425

Modifications contained in this build (not present upstream):

  * Camera roll - the view rolls together with the car body's cant, pivoting on the
    rail plane instead of the camera position, so the car interior does not block it.
  * Camera inertia - a spring-damper offset on the camera position, driven by the
    riding car's acceleration, with substep integration for frame-rate independence.
  * Interpolation fix - aligns MTR's per-render-frame position sync with Minecraft's
    partial-tick interpolation, removing the stuttering of the scenery while moving.
  * Compatibility fixes for running alongside YMTR.

